- Features mapped to APIs.
- Actual integrations completed.
- Remaining disconnected features.
- Real data displayed.

## E. Consistency and Architecture
- Contracts fixed.
- Rules consolidated.
- Duplicate logic removed.
- Shared modules improved.
- Code simplification.

## F. UI/UX
- Pages and workflows improved.
- Navigation and usability.
