- New ideas.
- Prior-art findings.
- Selected and deferred ideas.

## H. Three Development Phases
- Actual implementation.
- Changed modules.
- Verification results.

## I. Testing
- Unit tests.
- Integration tests.
- E2E tests.
- Real persistence checks.
